HB0084 Pari-mutuel wagering-breakage.
Sponsored By: Joint Appropriations Committee
AN ACT relating to pari-mutuel wagering; requiring distribution of historic
pari-mutuel event breakage amounts as specified; creating a definition; and
providing for an effective date.
